frames 10
click Daily Challenge
until 120 Run one tick (Space)
key Escape 2
until 30 Leave round
frames 5
click Leave round
until 60 Score Chase
click Score Chase
until 120 Run one tick (Space)
click Restart round
until 30 Round started.
key Escape 2
until 30 Leave round
frames 5
click Leave round
